00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:55.460
Paulo César Pinto de Farias

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:58.700
Enéas Bonara dos Santos

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:01.540
e Felipe Bonara dos Santos

